      "text": "Properties of Eigenvalues on Riemann Surfaces with Large Symmetry Groups — 26 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Background\n\n**Properties of Eigenvalues on Riemann Surfaces with Large Symmetry Groups**\n\n*Joseph Cook*\n\n163 pp, 26 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; Background; Spectral theory; Hyperbolic geometry; Harmonic analysis on H; Representation theory; Selberg's trace formula; Symmetry group of the Bolza surface; The Bolza Surface; Length spectrum of the Bolza surface; Upper bounds on eigenvalues of the Bolza surfa; First eigenspace of the Bolza surface; Second eigenspace of Bolza surface; The Klein Quartic; Systole of the Klein quartic; Fenchel-Nielsen parameters of the Klein quarti; Spectral theory of the Klein quartic",
